        "text_aRVGTQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our Test & Tag Training Courses in Victoria are run by our highly experienced resident trainer, Mark Juric. Mark has more than 20 <br/>years of experience in the electrotechnology industry and comes with a <br/>strong background in teaching. Mark has extensive working experience and<br/> knowledge of the test and tag standards in Australia.</p><p>If you're planning on taking our course at Caroline Springs or Rowville, Mark will be the trainer conducting the <a href=\"https://ttt-au.myshopify.com/products/face-to-face-course-vic\" title=\"https://ttt-au.myshopify.com/products/face-to-face-course-vic\">face-to-face Test & Tag Training Course</a>. Mark also teaches our <a href=\"/products/online-test-tag-course\" title=\"Online Test & Tag Courses\">online Test & Tag training Course</a>, which is run via a Virtual Classroom.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
